    "source": "",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A salvaged pre-Fall riot shield with the emitter coil still good. Thumb the stud and a crackling static field sheets across the face — it grounds incoming electrical and stands the hair up on everyone within arm's reach. Pairs with any one-handed weapon.</p><p><b>Active Ward.</b> While raised, the field bleeds off electrical damage; a melee attacker that hits you takes 1 electrical from the discharge.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Armor:</strong> Shield</li>\n  <li><strong>Defense:</strong> Guard +2</li>\n  <li><strong>Requires:</strong> Warding (trained)</li>\n  <li><strong>Resistance:</strong> Electrical</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> II</li>\n  <li><strong>Cost:</strong> 280 Economy marks</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->",
      "chat": ""
    }
